{{/* rulelink is a row's actions, beside the Rule column and labelled apart from it: Block this (a live run's exec or net row: opens the run page's Block now panel, filled in) and Make a rule (the event page's Act on this panel: a rule from this action). It takes acts: the event, the Block link, and whether a rule can be made from it (Rule: the run names a contract file and the row was refused or asked about). */}}
{{define "rulelink"}}{{with .Block}}<a class="link row-act act-block" href="{{.}}" title="Block this program or destination on the running agent from now on">Block this</a>{{end}}{{if .Rule}}{{with .E}}<a class="link row-act" href="/runs/{{pathEsc .Run}}/lines/{{.Seq}}#act" title="Block, ask or allow this next time">Make a rule</a>{{end}}{{end}}{{end}}
